 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Identify the slope and <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-intercept from the equation of the line.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 511130,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"y = 2x - 1\">y = 2x - 1</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>When the equation is in the slope-intercept form of the equation of the line,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = mx + b\"></span>.</p>\n<p><i>m</i> = the slope.</p>\n<p>(0, <i>b</i>) = the y-intercept.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = 2x - 1\"></span></td>\n<td>Since this equation is in slope intercept form, the slope is 2.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The <i>y</i>-intercept is (0, –1).</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "slope <span data-math=\"m = 2\">m = 2</span> and <span data-math=\"y{\\text{-intercept}} = (0,-1)\">y{\\text{-intercept}} = (0,-1)</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 511131,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"x + 4y = 16\">x + 4y = 16</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>When the equation is in the slope-intercept form of the equation of the line,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = mx + b\"></span>.</p>\n<p><i>m</i> = the slope.</p>\n<p>(0, <i>b</i>) = the y-intercept.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x + 4y = 16\"></span></td>\n<td>Solve for y.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x + 4y - x = 16 - x\"></span></td>\n<td>Subtract.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"4y = - x + 16\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4y}}{4} = \\frac{{ - x + 16}}{4}\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = - \\frac{1}{4}x + 4\"></span></td>\n<td>This is now in slope intercept form.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The slope is <span data-math=\" - \\frac{1}{4}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The <i>y</i>-intercept is (0, 4).</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "slope <span data-math=\"m =  - \\frac{1}{4}\">m =  - \\frac{1}{4}</span> and <span data-math=\"y{\\text{-intercept}} = (0,4)\">y{\\text{-intercept}} = (0,4)</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
